Subject: [PATCH 08/14] refactor: extract Download.try_sources

The inline download loop in _impl was ~90 lines handling source
failover, integrity warnings, patch application and failure tracking.
Extract it into a single function to simplify _impl and make the
download logic testable in isolation.
